Package: rk3399-vpu-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: linux-headers-arm64
Description: Hantro VPU driver with an H.264 encoder for RK3399 (DKMS)
 A patched copy of the Linux 6.12 hantro-vpu driver (drivers/media/platform/
 verisilicon), built with DKMS. It replaces the in-tree module and keeps all
 of its functions, and adds a stateful V4L2 H.264 encoder on the RK3399
 VEPU2 block, usable from FFmpeg's h264_v4l2m2m and GStreamer's v4l2h264enc.
